<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_space",
    "Every space has a Construct: an empty white room that the people of the conversation decorate together. A channel's Construct belongs to the channel, and a private conversation's Construct belongs to its two people. Nobody else can go in."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_community}>{dgettext("help_space", "Going in and out")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_space",
    "The gate full of falling green code stands on the north island of the End of Time, beside the old television. Walk up to it and press E: it asks whether to enter, and %{yes} takes you in wearing the same character. Inside, the white gate in the far corner asks the same way and brings you back.",
    yes: dgettext("chat", "Yes")
  )}
  {dgettext(
    "help_space",
    "On a touch screen, the hand button of the on-screen controls does the same as E."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_community}>{dgettext("help_space", "Placing pieces")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_space",
    "The palette in the top-left corner keeps the pieces in tabs: %{furniture}, %{structure} and %{fun}. Choose one and click the floor to place it. It stays in your hand, so a row of chairs is a row of clicks. A see-through copy shows where it would go: green where it fits, red where it does not. Esc, or choosing it again, puts it away.",
    furniture: dgettext("chat", "Furniture"),
    structure: dgettext("chat", "Structure"),
    fun: dpgettext("chat", "construct palette", "Fun")
  )}
</p>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_space",
    "Drag a placed piece to move it. Click a piece to select it: %{turn} or R turns it, and %{remove} or Delete removes it. A right-click removes a piece at once. On a touch screen, a tap places or selects a piece, and dragging moves it.",
    turn: dgettext("chat", "Turn"),
    remove: dgettext("chat", "Remove")
  )}
  {dgettext(
    "help_space",
    "Walls and corners turn like any other piece. A door in a wall lets people through."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_community}>{dgettext("help_space", "Pieces that do something")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_space",
    "Stand next to one of these pieces and press E, or the hand button on a touch screen."
  )}
</p>
<ul>
  <li>
    <strong>{dgettext("chat", "Lamp")}</strong>: {dgettext(
      "help_space",
      "Switches its light on or off."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    <strong>{dgettext("chat", "Door")}</strong>: {dgettext(
      "help_space",
      "Press E to open the door, and again to close it. It stays open while someone is in the doorway."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    <strong>{dpgettext("chat", "game piece", "Die")}, {dgettext("chat", "Coin")}</strong>: {dgettext(
      "help_space",
      "Press E. The result appears on the piece and in the chat."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    <strong>{dgettext("chat", "Teleporter")}</strong>: {dgettext(
      "help_space",
      "Press E on one teleporter to arrive at the other one of its pair."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    <strong>{dpgettext("chat", "signpost", "Sign")}</strong>: {dgettext(
      "help_space",
      "Shows a short text above it. Whoever put it up can change it, and the moderators can too."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    <strong>{dgettext("chat", "Arcade cabinet")}</strong>: {dgettext(
      "help_space",
      "Lists the games, and each one opens in a new tab."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    <strong>{dpgettext("chat", "notice board", "Board")}</strong>: {dgettext(
      "help_space",
      "Shows the channel's topic and the messages of its %{pinned} list. Only a channel's Construct has one.",
      pinned: dgettext("chat", "Pinned")
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    <strong>{dpgettext("chat", "television", "Screen")}</strong>: {dgettext(
      "help_space",
      "Shows the last picture posted in the conversation."
    )}
  </li>
</ul>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_community}>{dgettext("help_space", "Painting the floor")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_space",
    "In the %{floor} tab, pick a floor, then press and drag: the whole rectangle is painted. %{erase} makes it white again. You can walk on a painted floor and put pieces on it.",
    floor: dgettext("chat", "Floor"),
    erase: dgettext("chat", "Erase")
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_community}>{dgettext("help_space", "Together")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext("help_space", "Everyone inside sees each change at once.")}
  {dgettext("help_space", "The Construct is kept just as it was left.")}
  {dgettext("help_space", "Press F next to a chair or an armchair to sit down.")}
  {dgettext(
    "help_space",
    "The Construct is part of the space's gathering: its card stays open while anybody is in either room."
  )}
  {dgettext(
    "help_space",
    "Some places stay clear: the gate and the ground in front of it, the spots where people arrive, and the spot where somebody is standing. A chair with somebody sitting on it cannot be moved. A piece that would leave somebody with no way back to the gate is refused. The line under the palette says why a piece was refused."
  )}
</p>
